 External subroutine subprogram "cons"
  (inc)(line-no.)(nest)(optimize)
               1                           subroutine cons
               2                     !
               3                     !***********************************************************************
               4                     !  this subroutine defines several important constants and arrays
               5                     !  used by the spectral forecast model.  they include physical
               6                     !  parameters, model vertical structure, matrix operators used in
               7                     !  the semi-implicit algorthm, and polynomial arrays used in the
               8                     !  spherical harmonic transforms.
               9                     !
              10                     !
              11                     ! **** output: ***
              12                     !
              13                     !  restrt: logical variable set to .true. if initial tau is greater
              14                     !          than zero.
              15                     !
              16                     !  modify to f90 in 2015 by C-H Lee and sort by River Chen in 2015
              17                     !***********************************************************************
              18                     !
              19                           use param
              20                           use mpe
              21                           use rank
              22                           use index
              23                           use const
              24                           use spec
